Few things I want to emphasize,

00:25:05.646 --> 00:25:08.650
this is open-source, tight
collaboration with MSR.

00:25:08.651 --> 00:25:11.460
We'd like and seek collaboration

00:25:11.461 --> 00:25:12.800
with the research community on

00:25:12.801 --> 00:25:14.260
these projects that
I've talked about.

00:25:14.261 --> 00:25:17.175
There's a lot of spaces
to explore here,

00:25:17.176 --> 00:25:18.790
and we don't think we're

00:25:18.791 --> 00:25:20.320
going to be the ones
that can do all of it,

00:25:20.321 --> 00:25:23.365
so collaboration is
certainly welcome.

